{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p001771","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p001771"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p001771","label":"辰嬴（公子樂母）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"辰嬴","mention_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0090","c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0112"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0090","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p082","quote":"辰嬴"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0112","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p082","quote":"辰嬴"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"辰嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001771","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p082","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"辰嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001771","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p082","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji039-209","person_id":"cbr-p001771","surfaces":["辰嬴"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p082","quote":"七年八月，襄公卒。太子夷皋少。晉人以難故，欲立長君。趙盾曰：「立襄公弟雍。好善而長，先君愛之；且近於秦，秦故好也。立善則固，事長則順，奉愛則孝，結舊好則安。」賈季曰：「不如其弟樂。辰嬴嬖於二君，立其子，民必安之。」趙盾曰：「辰嬴賤，班在九人下，其子何震之有！且爲二君嬖，淫也。爲先君子，不能求大而出在小國，僻也。母淫子僻，無威；陳小而遠，無援：將何可乎！」使士會如秦迎公子雍。賈季亦使人召公子樂於陳。趙盾廢賈季，以其殺陽處父。十月，葬襄公。十一月，賈季奔翟。是歳，秦繆公亦卒。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p082","text":"七年八月，襄公卒。太子夷皋少。晉人以難故，欲立長君。趙盾曰：「立襄公弟雍。好善而長，先君愛之；且近於秦，秦故好也。立善則固，事長則順，奉愛則孝，結舊好則安。」賈季曰：「不如其弟樂。辰嬴嬖於二君，立其子，民必安之。」趙盾曰：「辰嬴賤，班在九人下，其子何震之有！且爲二君嬖，淫也。爲先君子，不能求大而出在小國，僻也。母淫子僻，無威；陳小而遠，無援：將何可乎！」使士會如秦迎公子雍。賈季亦使人召公子樂於陳。趙盾廢賈季，以其殺陽處父。十月，葬襄公。十一月，賈季奔翟。是歳，秦繆公亦卒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000396","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"太子夷皋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000412","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000396","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"雍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000406","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"賈季","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001769","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0086","start":86,"end":89,"surface":"其弟樂","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"辰嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001771","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"二君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"辰嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001771","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m082-0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"二君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或